{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09255","headline":"怀素友子西 · 韦应物","name":"怀素友子西","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"广陌竝游骑，公堂接华襟。\n方欢遽见别，永日独沈吟。\n阶暝流暗驶，气疎露已侵。\n层城湛深夜，片月生幽林。\n往款良未遂，来觌旷无音。\n恒当清觞宴，思子玉山岑。\n耿耿何以写，密言空委心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09255.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09255","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}